    <item>
      <title>当AI“长出灵魂”：Solulu如何构筑新时代的“哆啦A梦”</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aisolulua-20251117174004630-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 17:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
